1
00:00:00,397 --> 00:00:03,377
(Penny:)Thank you.
I really needed to hear that today.

2
00:00:07,137 --> 00:00:08,377
-Ooh! Brie's ready!
-Yay!

3
00:00:13,943 --> 00:00:16,083
(Leonard:)-Good morning.
-Hello.

4
00:00:17,614 --> 00:00:20,424
(Leonard:)So am I driving you to work,
or are you still mad at me?

5
00:00:20,583 --> 00:00:21,993
(Sheldon:)I'd like a ride.

6
00:00:23,086 --> 00:00:25,756
(Sheldon:)Assuming you actually do
take me to work.

7
00:00:25,922 --> 00:00:27,562
(Leonard:)Where do you think I would take you?

8
00:00:27,724 --> 00:00:31,934
Who knows? You said
you'd be home yesterday,

9
00:00:32,095 --> 00:00:33,805
(Sheldon:)but you came home three days ago.

10
00:00:33,963 --> 00:00:37,173
(Sheldon:)You say you're taking me
to work, but for all I know,

11
00:00:37,333 --> 00:00:41,143
(Sheldon:)I'll end up
in a deserted amusement park.

12
00:00:41,304 --> 00:00:43,974
Or a cornheld maze.

13
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:47,140
Or a back-alley dog fight.
You tell me.

14
00:00:48,678 --> 00:00:50,588
(Leonard:)I'm going to work.
You can come if you want.

15
00:00:50,747 --> 00:00:52,417
(Stuart:)Okay.

16
00:00:53,349 --> 00:00:56,159
(Sheldon:)By the way, you have
something on your shirt.

17
00:00:56,319 --> 00:01:04,019
(Leonard:)-No, I don't.
-Hurls, doesn't it?

